      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1898-11-18_WidnesExaminer_art0022" n="art0022">
        <head>ANSWERS TO CORRESPONDENTS.</head>
        <p>ANSWERS TO CORRESPONDENTS.</p>
        <p>Will" E. J. P." and" C. P." Warrington, kindly forward us their full name + and address, as their natues cannot be included in the ,Solvers' List until we receive same.</p>
        <p>J. DIIFFICY, Sr. HELENS: Many thanks for neat little problem, hope ta hear further from you. T. BARNS, WARRINGTON: Many thanks for problem. W. RIGBY, PADGATE ; Sorry to have disappointed you, but we cannot prepare the Solvers List for publication the same week.</p>
