      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1898-11-18_WidnesExaminer_art0024" n="art0024">
        <head>IRE EXAMINER FRIDAY, NOVEIVIDER 18 1898</head>
        <p>IRE EXAMINER FRIDAY, NOVEIVIDER 18 1898</p>
        <p>, (All rights reserved.) THE</p>
        <p>SECRET OF MARK PEPYS.</p>
        <p>BY FRED J. PROCTOR, Author of "Timothy Twill's Secret.* "Jean</p>
        <p>liarloll." "Dr. Dobbs." due</p>
