      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1898-11-18_WidnesExaminer_art0028" n="art0028">
        <head>LADIES' LETTER.</head>
        <p>LADIES' LETTER.</p>
        <p>DUB NELLIE. A charming hat which is suitable for the present le4Boo has a crown of white silk velvet, and a black 'velvet brim, trimmed with black chenille and baby tibboo. In front there is a handsome buckle, Which holds two black ostrich tips' between which beanies a pretty little white bird. The designs can be made in the above mentioned or in any other colour or combination of colours.</p>
        <p>A. beautiful black velvet hat has rows and rows 4; of black and white satin ribbon run on the brim, and also at the edge of the crown. In front there Ire placed some black velvet bovis, caught with I long paste buckle, which holds a large white ostrich feather; under the brim on the left side is a lung black ostrich feather, which rests on the hair. There are some very charming cloth coat cos- tumes to Iva seen this season ; but they depend tnuch upon cut and tioi.;h, for it is extremely sim- ple in design. The plain skirt is cut in three pieces only, viz., the narrow gored skirt, and the two umbrella-shaped sides, and this keeps the front flattand takes all the fulness quite to the back, while the hips are fitted closely, and the back finished with two flat pleats meeting in the centre ,Of the back. The back of this skirt is four inches Itmger than the front, and r,quires to be raised *hen walking, and even if not lined with silk, a ajoihked-out balayeuse of silk should be placed at teo.-, edge. The coat is perfectly plain and close- tti ~ 16 the basque short and tight, and bordered tli‘n black Persian lamb. The revers are of .e, same fur, and the fronts are decorated With tabs of braid arranged in military fashion, and faatuned with barrel buttons, or brandenburgs, 1.18 they are technically called. This costume t Issuitablei stable for coloured cloth, an dmore espe- t eially n any of the fashionable blue and heather itints, with black fur and braid; or it is effeo- tive in black cloth and grey chinchilla fur, with black braid down the fronts, and both coat and skirt lined with a medium grey silk- The hat, of grey felt, is trimmed with grey velvet and ' black plumes, and finished with a steel buckle. One of the fur ties to correspond can be worn out of doors, and removed for indoor functions.</p>
        <p>- costume consisting of coat and ..trt is made in cloth edged with beaver fur. The design looks well in any colour, such as braided With black and gold cord, and edged with astrachan. The collar and revers can be faced With white cloth if a more dressy effect is desired, or the braiding can also be done on white satin. This coat is also suitable for wearing as a jacket - silk or satin skirts for visiting, and if desired, be supplied without</p>
        <p>Over</p>
        <p>, Velvet coats cnxt in the modified Russian style taok well with plain cloth skirts, and a very charm- L..!°s combination is composed of skirt of grey face 'a:4h trimmed with rows of grey velvet ribbon, arranged in waved lines, and a jacket of grey Velvet with revers and collar of chinchilla and cut- glass buttons. As a rule these costumes are pro- vided with a bodice of the same material as the skirt, as well as a silk blouse to wear beneath the jacket, and in the case of a grey toilette such as that described, the blouse might be of grey and rose.pink striped glace, with grey velvet rosettes, While the cloth bodice could have full tucked fronts, ilhort, square revers, trimmed with rows cif grey velvet and a vest of ivory silk. 0 Velveteen is again in fashion as a material for house dresses, and one of the prettiest ways of aiog it up is with a rather long, plain skirt and . bodices,_, with draped fronts gathered up on the chest ' "low a yoke of thick lace laid on silk, which ap- ' again as a pouched vest below the velvet draping. This style carried out in deep-green v ior i elvnet, with a yoke of' cream lace over rose-pink, brown with orange yoke lining, looks par- tXltrly well. Another effective type of gown is—'cu can be when paying calls or at quiet parties ~_ of black rep trimmed with black lace laid over i aradc of white or coloured silk, and outlined with vAck velvet ribbon.</p>
        <p>Your loving JENNUL</p>
